    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐήρης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραρίσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>double,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διῆρες ὑπερῷον</span>
			<i>upper</i> story, <i>upper</i> chamber, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				112
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελάθρων διῆρες ἔσχατον</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῷον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				90
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.77e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>) <i>bireme, ship with two banks of oars,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.82
			</span></i>.</div>
